msgctxt "340"
msgid "The heck took you so long, Aniki? Let's move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Let's get going, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "What's took so long, Uncle Kaz? Let's go home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, that took forever! I wanna go home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "We, uh... goin' in, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Rikiya was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Yeah, you wanna come?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'm not really in the mood. I'll be chillin' out here\r\n"
"when you're done, though. Later, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Huh? Changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "You goin' in there, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Mikio was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Yeah, you wanna tag along?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "I appreciate the invite, sir... but I think I'm gonna pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Huh? Don't go changin' your plans on account of me, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Are you going in there, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Stai... andando lì dentro, zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "568"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Ayako was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Yeah, sorry. Mind waiting outside for a bit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "...Okay, but don't take too long!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? I don't mind, if that's what you're worried\r\n"
"about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"You're going in there, Uncle Kaz!? C'mon, we don't have\r\n"
"time for that kinda stuff right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Taichi was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Sorry, Taichi. I won't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Huh!? But Morning Glory's in trouble, Uncle Kaz! C'mon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "(He's right. Now's not the time for this.)"
msgstr ""

